13:"Once that service is built, how would you ship it? Talk me through containerizing it, deploying it, hooking it into CI/CD, and how you'd see what the agent is doing step by step in production.",
14:"Prompts change quite often. How do you manage prompts and agent configs so that a change in dev doesn't accidentally break prod?",
15:"Quick coding warm-up: can you reverse a linked list for me? And while we're there, how would you check whether a list has a loop in it?",
